      "slices": [
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 1.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "music": {
              "tracks": [
                {
                  "id": "calmness",
                  "volume": 0.2
                },
                {
                  "id": "tension",
                  "volume": 0.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 2.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-2-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 8.05, "width": 84.53, "height": 8.75}, "text": "2 INT. BEDROOM - NIGHT", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.15, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-2-2", "rect": {"x": 4.96, "y": 29.49, "width": 62.74, "height": 11.63}, "text": "A NEW DAY,\nTHE SAME OLD GAME!", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.07, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-2-3", "rect": {"x": 47.78, "y": 63.25, "width": 36.84, "height": 8.27}, "text": "MOM! WTF?", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.11, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 3.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-3-1", "rect": {"x": 14.96, "y": 49.65, "width": 77.35, "height": 9.55}, "text": "Phew! It was only a dream.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.06, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-3-2", "rect": {"x": 0.09, "y": 66.77, "width": 99.91, "height": 8.59}, "text": "PLF fell back asleep.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.04, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 4.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 5.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "samples": [
              {
                "id": "bells",
                "trigger": {
                  "type": "intersect",
                  "mode": "mono"
                },
                "volume": 0.5,
                "delay": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-5-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": -8.75, "width": 84.53, "height": 11.15}, "text": "3 EXT. BRUTALIST HOUSING BLOCK\n- SUNRISE", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.87, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 6.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-6-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": -38.99, "width": 84.79, "height": 46.03}, "text": "Every morning the sun rose, so it was written. It shifted, we knew that, with the position of the Earth relative to its star, and when it rained or there was too much fog, we could still be sure that behind it all, since the beginning of time, the same cosmic ritual was taking place. Shadow was followed by light, and the light was life, and with life my day began too.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.77, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 7.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-7-1", "rect": {"x": 6.5, "y": 38.45, "width": 86.84, "height": 21.39}, "text": "Still, to make sure this day would actually work, I set myself an alarm clock, a digital one, synced to an atomic clock.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.85, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-7-2", "rect": {"x": 6.5, "y": 67.89, "width": 86.84, "height": 7.63}, "text": "4 PAID AD - SIN TONIC", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.87, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 9.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-9-1", "rect": {"x": 8.03, "y": 29.01, "width": 84.79, "height": 10.99}, "text": "5 INT. BEDROOM -\nSUNRISE", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.83, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-9-2", "rect": {"x": 4.96, "y": 52.85, "width": 89.15, "height": 24.43}, "text": "We preaching beings had a duty to be the first to appear before the flock/folk and to perform our own rituals in front of them. That was just part of it...", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.85, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 10.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-10-1", "rect": {"x": 23.16, "y": 74.45, "width": 66.32, "height": 9.23}, "text": "I didn't mind.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.77, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 12.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-12-1", "rect": {"x": 5.47, "y": -42.51, "width": 84.53, "height": 50.51}, "text": "Still, I was well practiced at ignoring this ringing. Yes, practiced in the technique of lucid dreaming, a method in which the state of slumber could be used to steer your own dreams. An insanely exciting method; it was like living and writing a film at the same time, in full reality. An indescribable feeling of power.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.86, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 13.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-13-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": -9.55, "width": 85.56, "height": 17.23}, "text": "I forced the ringing into a trill. It multiplied a thousandfold, like on a DMT trip.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.86, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 14.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 15.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-15-1", "rect": {"x": 4.44, "y": -27.47, "width": 90.94, "height": 33.87}, "text": "I compressed it further until it became howling sirens.\nI took the sirens in turn as a sample. Stabilized them. With them I drew an invisible layer of angel-horn trumpets into the room and set the clouds in the highest hemisphere vibrating.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.84, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 16.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "music": {
              "tracks": [
                {
                  "id": "calmness",
                  "volume": 0.2
                },
                {
                  "id": "tension",
                  "volume": 0.5
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 17.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-17-1", "rect": {"x": 3.93, "y": 87.89, "width": 48.63, "height": 8.11}, "text": "Kitchen first.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.8, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 18.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-18-1", "rect": {"x": 20.85, "y": 65.01, "width": 25.16, "height": 8.11}, "text": "Protein!", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.5, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-18-2", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 79.09, "width": 84.53, "height": 8.11}, "text": "6 INT. KITCHEN", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.86, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 19.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-19-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 48.05, "width": 84.53, "height": 12.75}, "text": "PLF expertly cracked two eggs into a pan, perfectly in sync.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.81, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 20.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "music": {
              "tracks": [
                {
                  "id": "calmness",
                  "volume": 0
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-20-1", "rect": {"x": 7.01, "y": 37.81, "width": 86.07, "height": 20.59}, "text": "A sudden turn. Skid marks in the air. Eyes half closed, PLF went to the loo. Took a book. Sat down.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.83, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 21.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-21-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 31.89, "width": 84.53, "height": 8.11}, "text": "7 INT. LOO", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.88, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 22.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-22-1", "rect": {"x": 34.96, "y": 7.73, "width": 57.35, "height": 14.51}, "text": "Well, a bit profane, but good for telling stories.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.79, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-22-2", "rect": {"x": 6.24, "y": 71.57, "width": 57.35, "height": 14.51}, "text": "He made three rings and gave one to each son?", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.85, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 23.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-23-1", "rect": {"x": 51.62, "y": 86.77, "width": 44.53, "height": 8.43}, "text": "I knew it!", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.06, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 24.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-24-1", "rect": {"x": 4.44, "y": 60.05, "width": 91.2, "height": 34.03}, "text": "Who decides what is true?\nWho holds the keys to the stories?\nWhere is the difference between what I want and what I stage for others?\nWhom should I serve, if not three masters, the perfect trinity of chaos?", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.86, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 25.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-25-1", "rect": {"x": 4.44, "y": 25.81, "width": 72.48, "height": 31.47}, "text": "Of course the reading took longer than I cared to admit. I tended to lose myself in the text. Sucked in, as if I myself were the maid on the pyre.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.11, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 26.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 27.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "music": {
              "tracks": [
                {
                  "id": "calmness",
                  "volume": 0.1
                },
                {
                  "id": "tension",
                  "volume": 0.8
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-27-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 16.53, "width": 83.76, "height": 12.59}, "text": "All fetish? All show?\nDo I just want to entertain?", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.11, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 28.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-28-1", "rect": {"x": 20.09, "y": 7.25, "width": 69.66, "height": 25.39}, "text": "No, this is about more than the metaphor! Light fires. They should burn with emotion, right along with me.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.12, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 29.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 30.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-30-1", "rect": {"x": 19.57, "y": 73.96, "width": 52.22, "height": 3.66}, "text": "Holy moly, guacamole!", "variant": "bubble", "font": "mono", "size": 4.05, "align": "left", "valign": "top", "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0.3},
            {"id": "s1c1-30-2", "rect": {"x": 19.57, "y": 77.22, "width": 30.0, "height": 3.66}, "text": "My eggs!", "variant": "bubble", "font": "mono", "size": 4.05, "align": "left", "valign": "top", "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0.3}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 31.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "music": {
              "tracks": [
                {
                  "id": "calmness",
                  "volume": 0.2
                },
                {
                  "id": "tension",
                  "volume": 0
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-31-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 33.17, "width": 84.53, "height": 8.11}, "text": "8 INT. KITCHEN", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.86, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 32.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-32-1", "rect": {"x": 13.16, "y": 2.13, "width": 54.53, "height": 21.55}, "text": "Communion wafers later.\n\nOther things matter more...", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.1, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 33.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-33-1", "rect": {"x": 46.24, "y": 65.01, "width": 48.38, "height": 8.43}, "text": "... the routine!", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.97, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 34.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-34-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 0.37, "width": 84.53, "height": 8.11}, "text": "8 INT. BATHROOM", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.86, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-34-2", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 18.77, "width": 55.81, "height": 22.35}, "text": "Arriving at the sink, PLF grabbed the paste – the blue elixir came oozing out.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.02, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 35.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-35-1", "rect": {"x": 43.42, "y": 70.93, "width": 54.53, "height": 15.31}, "text": "Missed? WTF!\nNothing seems to work anymore.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.11, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 36.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-36-1", "rect": {"x": 22.65, "y": 71.25, "width": 69.66, "height": 11.47}, "text": "Yes, the second attempt worked …", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.97, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-36-2", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 84.69, "width": 25.34, "height": 8.43}, "text": "Thanks!", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.87, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 37.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-37-1", "rect": {"x": 5.47, "y": 53.01, "width": 64.79, "height": 18.35}, "text": "WE got it. Quiet now, I'm concentrating.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.97, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 38.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 39.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 40.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 41.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-41-1", "rect": {"x": 8.03, "y": 60.53, "width": 43.83, "height": 8.27}, "text": "What was that?", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.05, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 42.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-42-1", "rect": {"x": 17.52, "y": 21.17, "width": 66.84, "height": 9.71}, "text": "...", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.05, "align": "center", "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-42-2", "rect": {"x": 8.03, "y": 36.37, "width": 39.71, "height": 8.27}, "text": "It was there", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.14, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-42-3", "rect": {"x": 20.09, "y": 47.41, "width": 17.09, "height": 8.27}, "text": "Who", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.05, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-42-4", "rect": {"x": 37.26, "y": 59.41, "width": 19.04, "height": 8.27}, "text": "What", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.05, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-42-5", "rect": {"x": 48.03, "y": 72.21, "width": 38.89, "height": 10.51}, "text": "whose,\na being!", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.02, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 43.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-43-1", "rect": {"x": 8.03, "y": 1.17, "width": 45.3, "height": 11.63}, "text": "A cat beast?\nIn a bathrobe?", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.96, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-43-2", "rect": {"x": 3.76, "y": 85.79, "width": 94.19, "height": 7.18}, "text": "Nothing! Just as it appeared, it was gone again.", "variant": "narration", "frame": false, "size": 4.11, "align": "left", "valign": "top", "mask": "#faf4f4", "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0.3}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 44.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-44-1", "rect": {"x": 25.21, "y": 73.65, "width": 56.32, "height": 14.99}, "text": "Oh well, she's gone, probably just my imagination.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.1, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 45.jpg",
          "audio": {
            "samples": [
              {
                "id": "choir_once",
                "trigger": {
                  "type": "intersect",
                  "mode": "mono"
                },
                "volume": 0.8,
                "delay": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 46.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-46-1", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 57.81, "width": 84.53, "height": 8.59}, "text": "10 INT. VESTRY", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.12, "uppercase": true, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 47.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 48.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-48-1", "rect": {"x": 8.29, "y": 11.73, "width": 60.68, "height": 31.15}, "text": "Carefully, with a practiced hand, I slipped into the fine gabardine, whose plain white radiated its pious elegance.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.11, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 49.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-49-1", "rect": {"x": 36.24, "y": 45.97, "width": 56.07, "height": 52.27}, "text": "Gabardine, with its diagonally ribbed weave, lay taut against the body. Often wrongly dismissed as ordinary, it differed significantly from poplin, which was lighter and ribbed crosswise.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.04, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 50.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 51.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-51-1", "rect": {"x": 5.98, "y": 35.57, "width": 60.68, "height": 22.35}, "text": "But I couldn't let that distract me any further. I loved this ritual.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.02, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 52.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 53.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-53-1", "rect": {"x": 52.91, "y": 0.85, "width": 38.12, "height": 12.11}, "text": "Tying\nthe laces,", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.97, "align": "right", "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 54.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 55.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 56.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 57.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-57-1", "rect": {"x": 22.39, "y": 15.73, "width": 59.15, "height": 8.27}, "text": "folding the sleeves", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.08, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 58.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-58-1", "rect": {"x": 27.52, "y": 36.85, "width": 65.04, "height": 17.23}, "text": "– everything fit. I felt as pure as the fabric.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.98, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 59.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-59-1", "rect": {"x": 28.55, "y": 54.29, "width": 66.07, "height": 27.79}, "text": "As pious and fine as the seams of the corset. Tailored to the millimeter, it made my android-like figure shine.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.1, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-59-2", "rect": {"x": 18.8, "y": 84.21, "width": 75.81, "height": 8.59}, "text": "My way into the role!", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.04, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 60.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-60-1", "rect": {"x": 4.96, "y": 0.53, "width": 84.27, "height": 15.63}, "text": "No, it was no longer a role. The philosophers were arguing about identity.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.1, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0},
            {"id": "s1c1-60-2", "rect": {"x": 7.78, "y": 66.45, "width": 84.53, "height": 31.63}, "text": "Yes, spirituality/theology had the upper hand there. At last the self-confidence I had waited for so long today flowed through me. I was ready.", "variant": "narration", "size": 3.98, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 61.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 62.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-62-1", "rect": {"x": 8.8, "y": 92.2, "width": 83.76, "height": 3.68}, "text": "PLF strode out into the hallway.", "variant": "bubble", "font": "mono", "size": 4.07, "align": "left", "valign": "top", "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0.3}
          ]
        },
        {
