        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 74.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 75.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-75-1", "rect": {"x": 15.21, "y": -32.27, "width": 66.84, "height": 42.51}, "text": "In the year Mao Zedong and Ulrike Meinhof ascended to the Lord, we came down together. Honestly, they were pretty lucky to make it into heaven at all. They were hard to interpret.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.93, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 76.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 77.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-77-1", "rect": {"x": 10.09, "y": 1.65, "width": 82.22, "height": 23.15}, "text": "People like that deserve a second look. A youth without God. They probably wanted to become gods themselves. Consistent, they were.", "variant": "caption", "size": 3.99, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 78.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 79.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 80.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-80-1", "rect": {"x": 7.01, "y": 31.09, "width": 85.3, "height": 22.51}, "text": "That would make a great story, wouldn't it? Back then, science fiction just fit my self-image insanely well.", "variant": "narration", "size": 4.02, "align": "right", "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 81.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 82.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-82-1", "rect": {"x": 13.16, "y": 34.93, "width": 61.2, "height": 8.59}, "text": "There you are again?", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.05, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 83.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 84.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-84-1", "rect": {"x": 3.68, "y": 57.33, "width": 61.2, "height": 11.47}, "text": "Get lost! Beat it!\nBegone, you beast!", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.05, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 85.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-85-1", "rect": {"x": 8.55, "y": 83.09, "width": 61.2, "height": 11.47}, "text": "And you're ugly too.\nOMG! Mon dieu!", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.1, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 86.jpg"
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 87.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-87-1", "rect": {"x": 18.8, "y": -19.79, "width": 75.81, "height": 79.15}, "text": "CAT retreated, as if it had unlawfully crossed the shadows of reality, and stirred up a cloud of dust. In this moment of defense, a feeling came over PLF. They were reminded of the dystopian heroes of all the stories, from sci-fi to the depths of the holy texts – heroes who first had to fight their inner demons to find their true identity in a rigid world. PLF did not yet know how much this battle would now become part of their own journey.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.04, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 88.jpg",
          "dialog": [
            {"id": "s1c1-88-1", "rect": {"x": 11.62, "y": 72.37, "width": 75.81, "height": 21.23}, "text": "PLF walked on, striding through the meandering paths of the estate like Moses on a hoverboard through the Red Sea.", "variant": "caption", "size": 4.04, "mask": true, "maskShape": "rect", "pad": 0}
          ]
        },
        {
          "image": "images/3x/de/S1C1 - Slice 89.jpg"
        },
